# violet: the SSC accelerometer frame on libssc 0.4.4 / current iio-sensor-proxy reports Y=+9.8 with the phone upright (2026-11-03 measurement), i.e. rotated 180 degrees about Z relative to the device frame; undo it.
# (On the 2026-10-30 build the raw frame was already correct (Y=-9.92 upright) and the same rule made the UI upside down - see docs/PROGRESS.md 2026-10-30 21:55. Re-measure upright before touching this.)
SUBSYSTEM=="misc", KERNEL=="fastrpc-adsp-secure", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}="-1,0,0;0,-1,0;0,0,1"
